Subject: [PATCH 1/5] B1: bridge validate_pdf_template forwards required
 worst-case sample data

pdf-tool's validate_pdf_template requires `data` (the worst-case sample data
the validation render uses); the platform bridge's schema omitted it and
additionalProperties:false silently stripped it, so validation could never
pass. Add data to the tool's inputSchema/required list, require+forward it
in callValidatePdfTemplate, and forward it through validatePlatformPdfTemplate.

